@startuml
title UML sequence behaviour — The switch goes off
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
actor "Member" as actor
box "Frontend — Popkin web app" #E0F2FE
  participant "PlanBoardPage" as page
  participant "PlanBoardStore" as store
  participant "HttpPlanApi" as client
end box
box "Backend — Popkin API" #D1FADF
  participant "PlanController" as controller
end box
box "Backend — Popkin Application and Domain" #ECFDF3
  participant "SettingsFeatureSwitches" as switches
  participant "GetPlanBoardQueryHandler" as handler
end box
box "Backend — Popkin Infrastructure" #FFF4E5
  database "Popkin database" as db
end box
note over switches : The owner sets Features:Plan to false
store -> store : A minute after the last read (L2-077 AC4)
store -> client : board(popkinId)
client -> controller : GET /api/popkins/{popkinId}/plan
controller -> handler : Send GetPlanBoardQuery
handler -> switches : Require(Plan)
switches --> controller : 404 feature_off (L2-077 AC3)
controller --> client : 404 ProblemDetails code feature_off
store --> page : state off
page --> actor : "Plan is switched off", "Back to Cabin Week ’27" (L2-077 AC2)
note over db : Stories, the sprint and its history stay (L2-077 AC5)
actor -> page : Any other screen of the Popkin
page --> actor : The header says plan false: no Plan tab, Schedule follows Chat (L2-077 AC1)
@enduml
